cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "UROBOT TW: Open-source Taiwanese urology clinical decision-support AI"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  # TODO: 發表論文前請把 alias 換成真實姓名與 ORCID
  # 註：affiliation 依學術慣例填「進行本研究時的現職機構」，未確認者留空。
  - alias: PatentsOwnerJeff
    affiliation: "英普瑞斯股份有限公司 (Impress Co., Ltd.)"
