  - alias: Abigail1984
repository-code: "https://github.com/PatentsOwnerJeff/urobot-tw"
url: "https://patentsownerjeff.github.io/urobot-tw/"
abstract: >-
  UROBOT TW is an open-source retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) system for
  urology clinical decision support in Taiwan. It retrieves guideline passages,
  generates answers with a pluggable large language model, and cites the source
  of every point. Unlike existing systems, it targets Traditional Chinese,
  Taiwanese clinical practice and National Health Insurance reimbursement rules,
  and is not bound to any single model vendor. It includes a built-in evaluation
  harness benchmarked against the Rate of Correct Answers (RoCA) methodology.
keywords:
  - urology
  - clinical decision support
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - large language models
  - Traditional Chinese
  - Taiwan
  - open source
license: Apache-2.0
